rty, which featured an obstacle course and gummy bears), and immersive effe=
cts (https://thehustle.co/news/two-tickets-for-the-movie-that-rains-on-us-p=
lease?_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz-9BqSKhy0DkGXZT3qXDnkHZ57sUYkaHyeJ13m3GJ05A0rJtq9AmA8=
E40E7RLO7zKU7PFnA9l9ixfn1tsH2nz9BnUP1e1g&_hsmi=3D398166092 ) like vibrating=
 chairs and piped-in scents.

In a weirdly circular way, content made for at-home viewing, like sports ga=
mes and TV shows =E2=80=94 including streaming content =E2=80=94 are also g=
iving theaters a boost.

