<h2 style=3D"margin:0; line-height:150%; font-size:22px">First-class seats =
are coming to a theater near you</h2>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">For today=E2=80=99s moviegoers, it seems, ove=
rpriced popcorn and musty seats just won=E2=80=99t cut it.&nbsp;</p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
<li aria-level=3D"1">Movie theater attendance is down <a href=3D"https://me=
dia.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VWxwvz69SxLnN6dJ0jTMfBDZW8DFYQL5JdX=
19N8kT_BW2-ZW0W7lCdLW6lZ3kRW500mrk4F3X8xW8MWjsM27Kb1cW5vVfLf8Kpg_lW5QWfFp4Q=
