gF1jBSjDW2Xqjsg1pPZPqW31xFG45M4DsTf2jm0RW04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-h=
s-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"vp3aWKgm" target=3D"_blank">55%</a> c=
ompared to prepandemic highs, and box office sales have failed to rebound, =
with US cinemas pulling in ~$8.6B in 2025, short of analyst expectations an=
d far below 2019=E2=80=99s $11.4B haul, <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.co=
m/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VWxwvz69SxLnN6dJ0jTMfBDZW8DFYQL5JdX19N8kT_BC2-ZW0=
W6N1vHY6lZ3q5W1FxL8H7b5ypgV5Pqz53fyJVNN8vKFKGLwlMnW23CrnJ7z4PJbN2Brr4ml7Yx2=
VRHGnZ6qyB0NW8GBwh36LWcr-N5xZf3tlxj7zW8894JG6hC_3CV5r_Y87vLjFCW6YVyXl2Ldx_1=
