r><br></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">Meanwhile, streaming and straight-to-streaming release=
s have made at-home viewing convenient and cheap, and moviegoing a harder s=
ell.&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">But with Imax ticket sales proving a bright s=
pot for the industry, up <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+11=
3/d2q-Vf04/VWxwvz69SxLnN6dJ0jTMfBDZW8DFYQL5JdX19N8kT_Bj2-ZW0W69sMD-6lZ3nmN6=
