=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"pK58RVRj" target=3D"_blank">40%+</a> YoY in 20=
25, some theater operators are hopeful that premium offerings =E2=80=94 lik=
e Champagne and seats as comfy as your couch =E2=80=94 just might.&nbsp;</p=
>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">To lure people back to the silver screen, lux=
ury experiences are quickly becoming the new norm at a growing number of mo=
vie theaters, <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/=
VWxwvz69SxLnN6dJ0jTMfBDZW8DFYQL5JdX19N8kT_Cv2-ZW0W8wLKSR6lZ3lkW12gCL220hxmm=
